  outlines:
    count: 1-4, each a distinct color, 4-connected monochromatic
    closed: 1-3 per grid; 1-pixel-thick rectilinear loops with 8-14 corners
    open: 0-1 per grid; 1-pixel-thick path with 2 endpoints, no enclosed region [observed]
    area: 10-46 pixels; bbox 4x5 to 13x11
    non-overlapping: outlines do not share cells or overlap bboxes, min manhattan distance >= 3
